    <!-- Sunsoft FME-7 / 5B cartridge (mapper 69, with the 5B's three extra tone channels). The game's sound driver is
         called as the game's own NMI does: the update routine ($8009) once a frame and, to start a sound, the
         request routine ($8006) with the sound number in A; $8000 is its start-up routine. The routines run with the
         bank 0x07 at $8000 (the bank command 9) and the bank 0x00 at $A000 (command A); the driver sets the bank at
         $C000 (command B), where the DMC reads, by itself. Numbers 0x00-0x6E are the driver's requests; 0x6F and
         above are not sounds, and 0x3F is the same song as 0x3C. 0x3D, 0x3E and 0x43 end by themselves. -->
    <driver ram_clear="0x0000-0x07FF" init="0x8000" frame="0x8009" request_call="0x8006"
